---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service" description="වැඩHUB Terms of Service — rules and guidelines for using our construction marketplace">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 sm:py-16 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-400">Last updated: February 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">By accessing or using වැඩHUB ("the Platform"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use the Platform. වැඩHUB is a marketplace connecting homeowners with construction professionals across Sri Lanka.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">2. User Accounts</h2>
        <div class="mt-3 space-y-2">
          <p>To use certain features, you must register for an account. You agree to:</p>
          <ul class="ml-4 list-disc space-y-1">
            <li>Provide accurate, current, and complete information during registration</li>
            <li>Maintain the security of your password and account</li>
            <li>Notify us immediately of any unauthorized use of your account</li>
            <li>Accept responsibility for all activities that occur under your account</li>
          </ul>
          <p>Accounts are available as either "Homeowner" or "Professional" type. Professional accounts require verification of credentials.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">3. Professional Listings</h2>
        <div class="mt-3 space-y-2">
          <p>Professionals who list their services on වැඩHUB agree to:</p>
          <ul class="ml-4 list-disc space-y-1">
            <li>Provide accurate business information, including valid licenses where applicable</li>
            <li>Represent their skills, experience, and qualifications truthfully</li>
            <li>Respond to homeowner inquiries and quotes in a timely manner</li>
            <li>Deliver services as described and agreed upon with homeowners</li>
            <li>Maintain all necessary insurance and certifications required by Sri Lankan law</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">4. Project Postings</h2>
        <div class="mt-3 space-y-2">
          <p>Homeowners who post project requests agree to:</p>
          <ul class="ml-4 list-disc space-y-1">
            <li>Provide accurate descriptions of the work required</li>
            <li>Set realistic budgets and timelines</li>
            <li>Communicate honestly with professionals who submit quotes</li>
            <li>Honor agreements made with professionals through the Platform</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">5. Prohibited Conduct</h2>
        <div class="mt-3 space-y-2">
          <p>Users may not:</p>
          <ul class="ml-4 list-disc space-y-1">
            <li>Post false, misleading, or fraudulent content</li>
            <li>Impersonate any person or entity</li>
            <li>Harass, abuse, or harm other users</li>
            <li>Use the Platform for any unlawful purpose</li>
            <li>Attempt to circumvent the Platform to avoid fees or terms</li>
            <li>Scrape, mine, or collect user data without authorization</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">6. Fees & Payments</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">වැඩHUB is free for homeowners. Professional accounts may be subject to subscription fees or commission-based charges as outlined on our <a href="/pricing" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">Pricing page</a>. All payments are processed in Sri Lankan Rupees (LKR). Fees are subject to change with 30 days' notice.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">7. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">All content on වැඩHUB, including logos, text, graphics, and software, is the property of වැඩHUB or its content suppliers. Users retain ownership of content they upload (photos, descriptions) but grant වැඩHUB a non-exclusive license to display and promote such content on the Platform.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">වැඩHUB acts as a marketplace connecting homeowners with professionals. We do not employ the professionals listed, guarantee their work quality, or assume responsibility for disputes between users. Users engage with each other at their own risk. වැඩHUB shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">9. Dispute Resolution</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">Any disputes arising from the use of වැඩHUB shall be governed by the laws of Sri Lanka. Users agree to attempt to resolve disputes informally before pursuing formal legal action. වැඩHUB may offer mediation services but is not obligated to resolve user-to-user disputes.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">10. Termination</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">වැඩHUB reserves the right to suspend or terminate user accounts that violate these Terms. Users may delete their account at any time through their dashboard settings. Upon termination, your right to use the Platform ceases immediately.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">11. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">We may update these Terms of Service from time to time. We will notify users of significant changes via email or a notice on the Platform. Continued use of the Platform after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">12. Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">If you have questions about these Terms, please <a href="/contact" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">contact us</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
